      "title": "#4 守护重要的"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "623001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "来了？东西呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "东、东西……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "怎么支支吾吾的，说话！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "那批快递、包、包裹，被突然出现的几个家伙给劫走了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "你·说·什·么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "我们运送的快递包裹，被、被劫走了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "哦？被谁劫走了？查清楚了么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "没、没有，被她们逃了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "好、好、好，你们做得可真好。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "我、我们再也不敢了，再给我们一次机会，我保证下次……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623011",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "西瓜崽",
          "text": "啊！——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "很抱歉，你再也没有下次了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "…………",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "他的下场，你都看到了吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "看、看、看到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "很好，眼见为实，这就是让那位大人失望的代价。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奇奇",
          "text": "以后可要学机灵着点，不要再辜负那位大人的信任，知道了么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "623018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "原味崽",
          "text": "是、是、是，我知、知、知道了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-57",
