      "title": "#5 沉重的责罚"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "627001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "这里是医院。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "医院是人类生病后会去的地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "虽然人类看起来无所不能，但却很容易被病魔击倒。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "原来是这样，那玲之所以来这里是因为……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "小心跟上，注意不要惊动她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我来看你了，主人……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "你最近感觉好吗……还会觉得哪里痛吗……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "不要担心店里，你不在的这段时间，我有好好地照管。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "我还赚到了很多很多钱，你可以用它们看病。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玲",
          "text": "一定要早点回来哦，我会一直等你的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "这么说，玲转卖二手手办，全都是为了自己生病的主人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "岩田和江",
          "text": "应该就是这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "627013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "奥菲利亚",
          "text": "可是，葵的订单被他们擅自修改地址，是怎么回事？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-58",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "exceldata",
